Hexatra Lore – Mixed Licensing Notice
=====================================

This repository contains two different categories of content
with different copyright and licensing terms.

1. Hexatra Core (공통 규칙/가이드/템플릿)

- Location: the `hexatra-core/` directory and its subdirectories.
- Contents: common rules, strata system, transversal powers, official templates,
  and other core documentation of the Hexatra project.
- License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
  (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

This means:
- You must give appropriate credit.
- You may not use the material for commercial purposes.
- If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your
  contributions under the same license.

The full legal text of the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license is available at:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode


2. Individual Hexaplates (각 헥사판의 세계관, 캐릭터, 스토리 등 설정)

- Location: the `hexaplate-worlds/` directory and its subdirectories.
- Contents: individual worlds (Hexaplates), their settings, characters, and
  stories created by each owner.
- Copyright: remains with the respective creator (world owner) of each Hexaplate.
- Default license: All rights reserved, unless otherwise stated inside each
  world directory.

Using or creating derivative works based on the content inside `hexaplate-worlds/`
requires explicit permission from the respective creator, except where a different
license is clearly indicated by that creator.

Refer to the README files inside each world directory for any additional or
world-specific licensing information.
